# Brand Rules — Digital Vision Board

## Identity

| Attribute | Value |
|---|---|
| App name (display) | **Digital Vision Board** |
| Package / brand name | **habitseeding** |
| Flutter package ID | `digital_vision_board` |
| Android & iOS bundle | `com.habitseeding.app` |
| Firebase project | `habitseeding-prod` |

## Design Metaphor

> "Morning Garden" — warm soil, sage growth, honey seeds, morning mist.

Every UI decision should pass this test:
**Does this feel like 6 AM in a quiet garden — warm, grounded, alive, and never loud?**

If a widget, colour, animation, or copy feels loud, clinical, or anxious → it is wrong for this app.

## Tone of Voice

- **Calm and encouraging** — never urgent or pushy
- **Grounded** — practical, honest about progress
- **Warm** — personal, human, never corporate
- **Growth-oriented** — frame everything as planting and tending, not tracking or monitoring
- **Never gamified in a stressful way** — streaks and coins are rewards, not penalties

## Copy Guidelines

| Context | Do | Don't |
|---|---|---|
| Empty states | "Your garden is ready to grow." | "No data found." |
| Habit completion | "Seed planted today." | "Task completed." |
| Streak loss | "Every day is a fresh start." | "Streak broken!" |
| Onboarding CTA | "Let's plant your first habit." | "Get started now!" |
| Error messages | "Something went wrong — try again." | "Error 500." |
| Coin/reward labels | Use `AppColors.honeyText` amber text | Never raw gold hex as text |

## Visual Brand Don'ts

- No neon greens, electric blues, or clinical whites
- No dark navy backgrounds (use warm `#0F1510` Night Soil instead)
- No sharp corners on cards (minimum `radiusCard = 24`)
- No aggressive red error states — use `colorScheme.error` (muted)
- No all-caps headings

## Feature Naming Conventions

| Feature area | Brand name used in UI |
|---|---|
| Habit tracker | Habits / Seeds |
| Daily routine | Morning Ritual / Routine |
| Journal | Journal |
| Vision board | Vision Board |
| AI recommendations | Wizard |
| Points / currency | Seeds (coins) |
| Achievements | Milestones |
| Mood tracking | Mood |
| Affirmations | Affirmations |
